<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ADVANTA CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ADVANTA CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000</p>
<p>Advanta Championship women's tennis tournament on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Lori McNeil (U.S.) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 7-6 (7-3) 7-5</p>
<p>Zina Garrison Jackson (U.S.) beat Natalie Tauziat (France)</p>
<p>2-6 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Marianne Werdel Witmeyer (U.S.) beat 4-Anke Huber (Germany)</p>
<p>3-6 7-6 (7-4) 6-1</p>
<p>Chanda Rubin (U.S.) beat 6-Iva Majoli (Croatia) 5-7 6-2 6-1</p>
</text>
